Description: Python library for the Brother VC-500W label printer
 labelprinter speaks the network protocol of the Brother VC-500W (also sold
 as ColAura) colour label printer: it reads the printer's configuration and
 status (loaded tape, tape remaining) and sends print jobs.
 .
 This package contains the library only; Tavletta uses it to print on the
 VC-500W. It is built from a fork with fixes not yet merged upstream.
